't got a car.</td></tr><tr><td>You</td><td>You've got a map.</td><td>You haven't got a pet.</td></tr><tr><td>He / She</td><td>She's got a bicycle.</td><td>He hasn't got a laptop.</td></tr><tr><td>They</td><td>They've got two cars.</td><td>They haven't got a garden.</td></tr></table><p><b>I've got</b> = I have got. В речи — краткая форма.</p><p>С <b>he</b> и <b>she</b> — <b>has got</b> → she<b>'s</b> got.</p><p>Для «нет»: haven't got / hasn't got.</p>"},{"stage":"Грамматика","type":"note","title":"Have you got…?","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Вопрос</th><th>Да</th><th>Нет</th></tr><tr><td>Have you got a bicycle?</td><td>Yes, I have.</td><td>No, I haven't.</td></tr><tr><td>Has he got a pet?</td><td>Yes, he has.</td><td>No, he hasn't.</td></tr><tr><td>Have they got a car?</td><td>Yes, they have.</td><td>No, they haven't.</td></tr></table><p>Вопрос начинается с <b>Have</b> или <b>Has</b>.</p><p>В кратком ответе нет <b>got</b>: Yes, I <b>have</b>.</p><p><b>Has</b> — с he, she, it, как <b>is</b> в уроке 4.</p>"},{"stage":"Грамматика","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["I've got a laptop.","She's got a bicycle.","They haven't got a car.","Have you got a pet?","Yes, I have.","No, I haven't."]},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"I ___ got a laptop.","options":["has","have","haves"],"keep":false,"answer":"have","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"She ___ got a bicycle.","options":["have","haven't","has"],"keep":false,"answer":"has","why":"С she → has got.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"They ___ got a garden.","options":["haven't","hasn't","isn't"],"keep":false,"answer":"haven't","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"","after":"you got a map?","answers":["Have"],"bank":["Have","Are","Has"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"— Has he got a pet? — No, he","after":".","answers":["hasn't"],"bank":["hasn't","haven't","isn't"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"— Have you got a bicycle? — Yes, I","after":".","answers":["have"],"bank":["am","have","has"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"cols","title":"have got или has got?","sub":"","columns":["have got","has got"],"items":[{"text":"he","col":1},{"text":"she","col":1},{"text":"they","col":0},{"text":"my sister","col":1},{"text":"I","col":0},{"text":"you","col":0}]},{"stage":"Практика","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["a","got","have","laptop.","new","I"],"answer":"I have got a new laptop.","why":""},{"stage":"Практика","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["a","pet?","Have","got","you"],"answer":"Have you got a pet?","why":""},{"stage":"Практика","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["got","She","car.","not","has","a"],"answer":"She has not got a car.","why":""},{"stage":"Практика","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["She","have","got","a","bicycle."],"bad":1,"answer":"She has got a bicycle.","why":"С she → has got."},{"stage":"Практика","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["Yes,","I","have","got."],"bad":3,"answer":"Yes, I have.","why":"В кратком ответе нет got."},{"stage":"Практика","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["I","not","have","got","a","car."],"bad":1,"answer":"I haven't got a car.","why":"Нужно haven't got."},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. 